WEBVTT

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:33.650
Because even the smallest mistake 
could cost us the entire mission.

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:38.830
NASA, Russia, Japan, China’s missions 
had already experienced something similar.

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:43.220
And none of these missions succeeded
in their first attempt.

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:45.620
We all got down to work.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:50.590
While the hardware of previously 
successful missions was being used,

00:03:50.590 --> 00:03:53.930
the autonomy software was a big challenge.

00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:57.450
Electrical, electronics and
mechanical Engineers

00:03:57.450 --> 00:04:00.260
were consulted to come up with software